# Default multi-model fleet for herdr-multi-agent — author's usual four (daily).
#
# Heavy / max-diversity list: see fleet.full (pass --fleet-file $SKILL_DIR/fleet.full).
#
# WARNING: These model ids are author-specific. Third parties almost certainly
# need to override via:
#   --agent name=provider/model[:thinking]   (repeatable)
#   --agent name=kind:model                  (non-pi herdr kinds, e.g. cursor)
#   --fleet-file PATH
# or by editing this file.
#
# launch.sh runs kind-aware model preflight (unless --skip-model-preflight):
#   pi     -> pi --list-models
#   cursor -> cursor-agent --list-models (37890 env if listening; same as pane-export)
#   codex  -> `codex login status` + ~/.codex/models_cache.json
# and fails fast if entries are missing.
#
# Format:
#   shortname=provider/model[:thinking]   # kind=pi (default)
#   shortname=kind:model                  # herdr kind prefix (cursor/codex/...)
# Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Rationale (2026-08-12 dual-review gpt56sol + fable5;
#            2026-08-14 Go seat: glm53 replaces qwen38max;
#            2026-08-16 Cursor seat: k3max added;
#            2026-08-19 Go hy3: daily after quota 8x;
#            2026-08-20 drop glm52 + k27code as out of date;
#            2026-08-20 drop dots3 as unusable;
#            2026-08-21 Zen free oxalpha: Ox Alpha / x-preview-f-free:max
#            2026-08-21 SiliconFlow daily: dsv4flash 0731 replaces dsv4pro preview
#            2026-08-22 gpt56sol: ChatGPT Codex sub dead; switch to cursor:gpt-5.6-sol-xhigh
#            2026-08-22 oxalpha: OpenRouter stealth/ox-alpha (OpenCode Go/Zen unstable)
#            2026-08-23 g37flash: Antigravity CLI gemini-3.7-flash-high
#            2026-08-25 drop glm53: OpenCode Go quota exhausted
#            2026-08-26 drop hy3: OpenCode Go quota exhausted
#            2026-08-26 drop oxalpha: OpenRouter stealth/ox-alpha unusable
#            2026-09-02 drop g37flash: user requested remove gemini-3.7-flash
#            2026-09-02 fable51: cursor claude-fable-5-1-thinking-high replaces fable5
#            2026-09-03 g38flash: cursor gemini-3.8-flash-high (Cursor catalog; not agy)
#            2026-09-03 glm53: siliconflow zai-org/GLM-5.3:max (CN public id; not OpenCode Go)
#            2026-09-05 gpt6astra: official Codex CLI gpt-6-astra:high; drop cursor gpt56sol
#            2026-09-09 musespark: cursor muse-spark-1.3-max
#            2026-09-10 dsv4flash: DeepSeek Harness official deepseek-flash (V4.1); drop SiliconFlow V4-Flash
#            2026-09-12 hy4prev: siliconflow tencent/Hy4-preview:max
#            2026-09-14 drop k3max + g38flash + musespark from daily: Cursor usage; keep fable51 only
#            2026-09-15 heavy: drop mimopro; put k3max + g38flash + musespark in fleet.full only
#            2026-09-16 drop gpt6astra; add grok46=cursor:cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh-fast
#            2026-09-20 move fable51 to fleet.full only):
#   - Keep daily anchor: cursor grok 4.6 xhigh-fast
#   - No Codex seat; gpt6astra is out of both fleets
#   - Daily Cursor seat: grok46 only
#   - Heavy extra Cursor seats: fable51 + k3max + g38flash + musespark (not in daily)
#   - No Antigravity seat; g37flash is out of both fleets
#   - No opencode-go seat; hy3, Go glm53, and mimopro are out of both fleets
#   - No OpenRouter seat; oxalpha is out of both fleets
#   - Daily DeepSeek seat: dsv4flash = dsh official deepseek-flash:max (V4.1 Flash)
#   - SiliconFlow daily seats: glm53 (GLM-5.3 max) + hy4prev (Hy4-preview max)
#   - oxalpha, hy3, glm52, k27code, dsv4pro, dots3, g37flash, gpt56sol, gpt6astra, and mimopro are out of both fleets
#   - Drop opencode-go k3 entirely; qwen38max is out

# Cursor CLI via herdr agent start --kind cursor; pane export uppercase 37890; --trust --force
grok46=cursor:cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh-fast
# dsh-TUI in a Herdr pane (not herdr --kind); official API deepseek-flash = V4.1 Flash
dsv4flash=dsh:deepseek-flash:max
glm53=siliconflow/zai-org/GLM-5.3:max
hy4prev=siliconflow/tencent/Hy4-preview:max
